rch complete). Also searched reports that started in the 30 days before and were still running (1 open that day; earlier search complete). No matching report found in a complete search.","status":"no_report_after_deadline","incident":null,"matched_facility_id":null,"source_url":"https://www2.tceq.texas.gov/oce/eer/","checks":[{"at":"T+24h","status":"no_report_after_deadline","note":""},{"at":"T+14d","status":"no_report_after_deadline","note":""}],"reported":null},"corridor":{"origin_site_id":"48_201_1015","half_width_deg":22.5,"max_km":15.0,"wind_from_deg":[229.0,210.0]},"packet":{"draft_en":"On February 3, 2024, the Texas state monitor at Lynchburg Ferry recorded 55.08 ppb of benzene in the 11:00 p.m. CST hour, against a 7-day median of 0.42 ppb. Wind there came from 210 degrees at 4.1 mph. 34 major permitted facilities lie in the upwind corridor. No matching report found in a complete search of that day's emissions-event records for Harris County. That does not show who or what caused the reading. Requested follow-up: confirm whether any facility in this corridor reported a release that hour.","draft_es":"El 3 de febrero de 2024, el monitor estatal de Texas en Lynchburg Ferry registró 55.08 ppb de benceno en la hora de las 11:00 p. m. CST, frente a una mediana de 7 días de 0.42 ppb. El viento venía de 210 grados a 4.1 mph. Hay 34 instalaciones permitidas importantes en el corredor de donde venía el viento. No se encontró un informe correspondiente en una búsqueda completa de los registros de eventos de emisiones de ese día en el condado de Harris. Eso no indica quién o qué causó la lectura. Seguimiento solicitado: confirmar si alguna instalación en este corredor reportó una emisión a esa hora.","drafted_by":"template (deterministic, no AI)","guard":{"passed":true,"rejected":[]}},"cannot_say":["A matching report is not proof the facility caused every reading; other sources can add to a spike.","'Not yet reported' is not a finding about any facility: Texas requires 